Selected Full-Stack MVP sequence item 8: `US-093 Realtime Authorized Server Refetch Result UI`, lane `normal`, browser-visible UI slice.

Implemented the bounded US-093 slice:
- `app/realtime-refresh-plan.ts` now scopes the realtime authorized refetch/query-result proof to the current route surface and derives a safe ready/validation-stopped server query result status.
- `app/realtime-refresh-panel.tsx` renders the safe server query result status in the protected Realtime panel.
- `app/(student)/dashboard/page.tsx` passes the authorized student current-turn dashboard snapshot into the panel config.
- `app/(instructor)/instructor/dashboard/page.tsx` passes a composed authorized instructor current-turn dashboard snapshot into the panel config.
- Added `app/realtime-refresh-plan.test.ts` for student ready, instructor ready, and safe missing-snapshot validation status.
- Added `docs/stories/US-093-realtime-authorized-server-refetch-result-ui.md`.
- Updated `docs/stories/backlog.md`, `docs/TEST_MATRIX.md`, and product docs to record US-093 and keep hosted provider proof out of scope.
- Sequence preflight was recorded in `.claude/sprint-runs/round-164-20260519-realtime-server-refetch-result.log`.

Validation passed:
- `npm run test:unit -- app/realtime-refresh-plan.test.ts` — passed, 1 file / 3 tests.
- `npm run typecheck` — passed.
- `npm run validate:quick` — passed, 43 files / 490 tests.
- `npm run smoke:routes` — passed for `/`, `/login`, `/dashboard`, `/instructor/dashboard`.

Out of scope for this slice remains: hosted Supabase publication/subscription proof, live provider-backed server query execution after refresh, auth/RLS provider integration proof, E2E/platform/release proof, live Supabase reads/writes, and processed-order database mutation. I did not commit, push, or create a PR.

